  "chapter": "LV_LOW_VOLTAGE",
  "description": 'A multiblock upgrade of the §bEarth Sieve§r that runs the recipes at a parallel of §a16§r, effectively making it §a8 times faster§r than the single-block. (Note: you need 4 steam output busses to run the gravel seive recipe)

I do hope you have some decent §7steel production§r up as well as having your §3steam infrastructure§r still going strong with the initial cost of this machine!


---



